--------------------------- MODULE SingleCounter ----------------------------
EXTENDS Naturals

VARIABLE x

Init ==  x = 1

Next ==
    /\ x < 5
    /\ x' = x + 1
 \/ /\ x >= 5
    /\ x' = x

Spec == Init
        /\ []Next
        /\ WF_<<x>>(Next)
        /\ <>[](x = 5)

=============================================================================